  "body": "Positioned in the heart of sought-after Bucklands Beach and tucked privately at the end of the block, this near-new freestanding home delivers the perfect blend of modern design, family functionality, and exceptional school zoning.\r\n\r\nSet on a freehold site with approximately 171sqm of well-designed living space, this impressive residence offers four generous bedrooms, four bathrooms, and three ensuites, making it an ideal choice for growing families, multi-generational living, professionals, or those seeking space for guests.\r\n\r\nThe light-filled open-plan living and dining area forms the heart of the home, complemented by a contemporary kitchen with ample storage and seamless indoor-outdoor flow to a sunny balcony. A versatile study or sitting area provides additional flexibility for working from home, studying, or simply relaxing.\r\n\r\nHighlights\r\n- Four bedrooms and four bathrooms\r\n- Three bedrooms with their own ensuite\r\n- Double internal-access garage plus additional off-street parking\r\n- Freehold title with a secure, low-maintenance yard\r\n- Modern construction and stylish finishes throughout\r\n- End-of-block position offering added privacy\r\n- Within the prized Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Pigeon Mountain School zones\r\n- Walking distance to all three schools\r\n\r\nConveniently located close to Bucklands Beach, Half Moon Bay Marina, local shops, cafes, and public transport, this home offers an outstanding lifestyle in one of East Auckland's most desirable neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nModern, spacious, and exceptionally well located, this is an opportunity not to be missed. The vendor is motivated and ready to sell. Contact us today to arrange your viewing.",
